\[
a \cdot \frac{1}{b} - a^2 + \frac{1}{b} \cdot \frac{1}{b} - a \cdot \frac{1}{b}
\]
The terms \(a \cdot \frac{1}{b}\) and \(-a \cdot \frac{1}{b}\) cancel each other out, leaving:
\[
\frac{1}{b^2} - a^2
\]

