\[
(1 + (\sqrt{2} - 1))( (\sqrt{2} - 1) + 1 ) = (\sqrt{2})(\sqrt{2}) = 2
\]

Therefore, the minimum value is \(\boxed{2}\). 58%|█████▊    | 233/400 [4:49:05<3:48:56, 82.25s/it]
