1. \( P(x) - Q_1(x) = (a - 1)x^2 + (b + 2)x + (c - 2) \) must be non-negative for all \( x \).
2. \( Q_2(x) - P(x) = (2 - a)x^2 + (-4 - b)x + (3 - c) \) must be non-negative for all \( x \).

